  "description": "Erection of an incidental garden room.",
  "development_type": "Other house holder developments",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed outbuilding by reason of its height, scale and design, would dominate the rear garden of the site and detract from the open character of the rear garden environment, failing to appear as a subordinate garden addition, harming the character and appearance of Holly Lodge Estate Conservation area and detracting from the visual amenity of neighbouring occupiers.  It would therefore be contrary to Policies A1, D1 and D2 of the Camden Local Plan 2017 and policy DH2 of the Highgate Neighbourhood Plan 2017."
